800 GOSUB 6100:BM$="David walked through the open gate, and followed a path leading to yet\another gate.":GOSUB 5100:GOSUB 9000
810 GOSUB 6110:BM$="After crossing the gate, he found himself on a path next to a stone wall.":GOSUB 5100
900 GOSUB 9570:BM$="Suddenly, the voices of countless people came out of the next gate.":GOSUB 5100
1000 BM$="David: I think this is French...?\Whoa! I-It's coming this way!":GOSUB 5100
1010  BM$="David gestured frantically, as he didn't understand French."::GOSUB 5100
1020 BM$="David: ...I need to get out of here!":GOSUB 5100
1030 '
1040 GOSUB 6120:BM$="David ran towards the town to get away from those countless voices.":GOSUB 5100
1050 BM$="David: Ahhh! It's getting closer! I need to run!":GOSUB 5100
1051 '
1052 GOSUB 6130:BM$="David noticed an alley, and hurried in there in order to hide.":GOSUB 5100
1053 BM$="David ran through the alley, trying not to make any sounds.":GOSUB 5100
1060 GOSUB 6140:BM$="The alley led to a dark, gloomy square.":GOSUB 5100
1070 BM$="David: Is this...a square?":GOSUB 5100
1080 BM$="There was something - or someone - standing in the middle of the square.":GOSUB 5100
1090 BM$="David: It's too dark to make it out... What is that?":GOSUB 5100
1095 GOSUB 5820:BM$="Once he got used to the darkness, David could just barely make out a\figure.":GOSUB 5100
1096  GOSUB 6220:BM$="David: There's someone tied to a pillar... And there's a lot of firewood\below them. I don't understand.":GOSUB 5100
1100 BM$="David took a single step forward...":GOSUB 5100
1110  GOSUB 6150:BM$="Suddenly, a man came out of the shadows, throwing a lit torch into the pile\of wood.":GOSUB 5100
1115 GOSUB 6160:BM$="`Ahhh!`\The pained scream of a woman came from the flames.":GOSUB 5100
1120 BM$="The pile of wood instantly burst into flames, as if it were coated in oil.":GOSUB 5100
1125 GOSUB 6180
1130 BM$="There was a person amidst the fire... A young woman. Tied to the pillar, she\was unable to escape the flames. She could only writhe in pain.":GOSUB 5100
1140 BM$="David: She's being burned at the stake...":GOSUB 5100
1150 GOSUB 6160:BM$="David witnessed the grisly scene in a daze...":GOSUB 5100
1160 BM$="When he came back to his senses, hundreds of people were surrounding\the blazing pillar, all shouting together.":GOSUB 5100
1170 BM$="People: Death to the witch! Death to the witch! Death to the witch! Death to\the witch! Death to the -":GOSUB 5100
1180 BM$="To David, their words felt like a curse.":GOSUB 5100
1190 BM$="David: `Death to the witch?` The witch-hunts... France... Burning at the\stake...\No way! Is she Joan of Arc?!":GOSUB 5100:BM$="Am I in the past? No, it can't be!":GOSUB 5100
1200 BM$="David felt like he had lost his mind...":GOSUB 5100
1210 BM$="David: They're way too agitated. I can't stay here! I need to run!":GOSUB 5100
1220 BM$="David took a step back, attempting to run away. At that very moment, the\entire crowd turned his way.":GOSUB 5100
1230 GOSUB 6230:BM$="David: D-Damn it! They noticed me!":GOSUB 5100
1240 BM$="David had never felt so terrified before.":GOSUB 5100
1250 BM$="David: I have to find somewhere to hide! I don't care where!":GOSUB 5100
